{
  "title": "Quietly Fluffy Tunisian Shungiku Pilaf",
  "description": "A comforting and flavorful Tunisian dish featuring shungiku, perfect for a sick day, with a jammy and fluffy texture, made with fry-grind-rice-khao-khua, and low in sodium.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
